# Dependencies
node_modules/
# package-lock.json is deliberately TRACKED (un-ignored 2026-08-12). Without it
# neither CI nor the Cloudflare Pages build had a lockfile, so every build
# resolved dependencies fresh from the registry. That is how `canvas` moved to
# 3.2.3 and stopped compiling on the GitHub runner, and how the generated
# THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt drifted from the committed copy -- the notices record
# exact versions, so a floating install makes them look stale.
# `npm ci` also fails outright (EUSAGE) with no lockfile present.

# Build outputs (generated by CI — see deploy.yml)
